### 4.3 Three-Way Matching Validation (PO-GRN-Invoice)

**Current Status:**
```python
# In PurchaseOrderNormalizer:
grn_qty = GRN.objects.filter(po_id=po.id).aggregate(Sum('qty'))['qty__sum']
invoice_qty = Invoice.objects.filter(po_ref=po.id).aggregate(Sum('qty'))['qty__sum']

if po_qty == grn_qty == invoice_qty:
    result.status = "pass"  # ✅ Three-way match
else:
    result.status = "fail"  # ❌ Discrepancy
```

**Result: ✅ THREE-WAY MATCHING LOGIC IMPLEMENTED**

