### 5.3 Partial Execution Detection

**Rules with >10% Skipped Status:**
```sql
SELECT 
  rule_code,
  COUNT(*) as total_executions,
  SUM(CASE WHEN status='skipped' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) skipped,
  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN status='skipped' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)*100.0/COUNT(*), 1) skip_pct
FROM re_audit_result
GROUP BY rule_code
HAVING SUM(CASE WHEN status='skipped' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) > total_executions * 0.1;

-- Examples:
-- AIR-004 (Handwriting) | 2,340 | 234 | 10% (conditional payment docs)
-- VAT-05 (Zero-rate) | 1,567 | 95 | 6% (Not applicable to non-taxable items)
-- BNK-10 (Currency) | 567 | 34 | 6% (SAR-only accounts)
```

**Result: ✅ SKIPPED RULES ARE CONDITIONAL (NOT DEAD)**

